@startuml
autonumber
actor "Gym User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User
User -> System : openWorkoutsScreen()
activate System

note right of System: Configures toolbar with back navigation\nand displays empty workout list.

System --> User : displays Workouts screen with back arrow and Add Workout button

opt User clicks Back Navigation Arrow
    User -> System : clickBackArrow()
    System --> User : finishes screen and returns to Main Dashboard
end

deactivate System
deactivate User
@enduml
